I've just spotted a possible bug in nethack 3.0 patchlevel 7: playing a knight
( born with leather gloves ) I found a pair of "old gloves". If I understand
correctly, the "old" means what "glowing" does in "glowing potion".
I decided to test the gloves but mistyped: wm for Wm and so was wielding
a pair of old gloves. No problem, I'll just take off the leather gloves and
wear the old ones - but the program did not allow me to remove my original
gloves because I was wielding a cursed weapon. Sure enough, my inventory
showed (m) a cursed pair of old gloves.
But then when I typed wa the program allowed me to wield my sword! Thus I
got a free curse check on these gloves! ( On death I noticed that they
were indeed cursed, by the way ). 

Meanwhile, the Rueful Rabbit was trying to get a count on his own hand.


